window.products.push({"id":1152017,"name":"Zesthouse Modern Dining Chairs Set of 2, Mid Century Velvet Accent Chairs, Upholstered Desk Chairs with Metal Legs, Comfy Side Chairs with Curved Wing","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81OBLT2FfdL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"♞UNIQUE DESIGN: Paring slender profile with exaggerated graceful rounded back is available in well-known conception of excellent accent chairs. Different from traditional design, it substitutes armrests with outward sleek protrusions no longer wrapping whole overstuffed cushion. This unique and soft chair stands out as an admirable addition to modern household, meanwhile increasing the utilization of floor space. ♘VERSATILE: We can use ‘lightness’ to describe this glamorous dining chair unbelievably which adopts classic minimalism elements. Besides capturing your eyes with spectacular visual punch, it perfectly coordinates with almost any furniture like office desks, variable unfinished closets and parlour seating ensemble. Whether reading nook, social area or conversation pit, this accent chair will always enhance sophisticated atmosphere and contributes a touch of elegance. ♔CLASSIC FRAME: A classic four-legged base in matte black powder coating. I dare to make a bet that nobody is unfamiliar with this distinguished design whenever talked about. The light frame is a hymn to simplicity and durability representing the minimalism of mid-century style. Four tapered slender steel tubes and anti-slip black foot caps make up the significant structure, having integrated with fabulous sturdiness and durability. ♕VELVET TREND: Modern charm absolutely radiates from this vibrant and vivid living room chair. Whenever talking about the mainstay of interior design schemes all over the world, soft and glossy velvet is always the core argument. The themes of velvet are diversified, already breaking out the tradition and make a name for themselves across styles like cottage, rustic, and even minimal. No doubt that modern style meets all-encompassing comfort deserves your investment. ♝ASSEMBLY: Easy to assemble. We provide all the necessary hardware and tool, and an illustrated installation manual. You can free up more time to spend with family and play with friends. Our chairs are brand new products, if you encounter difficulties in the assembly process, please feel free to contact us!","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81OBLT2FfdL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Zesthouse","source_asin":"B09BVG2Z3M","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1152017","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09BVG2Z3M","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B09BVG2Z3M","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
