window.products.push({"id":1152241,"name":"Thank You For Being Awesome - 30 oz Mint Insulated Stainless Steel Tumbler w/ Lid - Birthday Christmas Present Gift Ideas for Women Men Wife Husband S","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":26.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61DpfcpEsYL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"TOP GIFT FOR THE FABULOUS PEOPLE IN YOUR LIFE WHO ARE TRULY AWESOME! Husband, Wife, Father, Mother, Grandma, Grandpa, Sister, Brother, Aunt, Uncle, Best Friend, Girlfriend, Boyfriend or Coworkers. They will cherish it everyday and smile at the fun memory of when you gave it to them for their bday. You'll hear that you found their new favorite cup! Each tumbler comes individually gift boxed. DOUBLE WALL, VACUUM INSULATED STAINLESS STEEL CONSTRUCTION. This cup is made from premium 304 18/8 food grade stainless steel. It's perfect to keep hot drinks steaming and cold beverages icy for hours and won't sweat like lower quality tumblers. The seamless stretch technology used to produce our tumblers ensures they will perform as expected for years to come. A clear BPA free press in lid helps to minimize spills and keep your drink at the the right temperature. BEAUTIFUL AND TIMELESS DESIGN. Why settle for a boring gift when you can give them a classy and personalized insulated stainless steel tumbler they can use everyday? Our durable powder coated tumblers are superior to less expensive painted tumblers. The artwork is laser engraved and will never come off or fade. The unique artwork makes it a gift that will never become outdated! GREAT NOVELTY PRESENT FOR BIRTHDAY CELEBRATIONS AND MORE. Birthday, Christmas, Mothers Day, Fathers Day, Retirement or any day you want to make someone feel special. It's sure to be a huge hit at the next birthday party and is also great to give as gag gift or stocking stuffer. Buy more than one to give as party favors or use as a fun party decoration. They will make your big event truly awesome. BACKED BY OUR 100% LOVE IT PROMISE. We expect the recipients of our personalized stainless steel tumblers to absolutely LOVE them. If for some reason they don’t, please return it for a no questions asked full refund.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61DpfcpEsYL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Sodilly","source_asin":"B09X1SVK8M","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1152241","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09X1SVK8M","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B09X1SVK8M","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
