window.products.push({"id":1152244,"name":"Flowersea Colorful Reusable Glass Water Bottles With Swing Top Leakproof Cap, 1L / 34oz, Glasss Water Bottle for Oil, Vinegar, Beverages, Beer, Water,","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/610nNjIlSKL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Make Life Colorful -- An top of the line bottles that a homebrewer looking for. Beautifully colored glass is an best option as gift to friends or family. Solid & Safe -- Very thick & solid glass for safe storage. They are a good thickness and have been keeping pressure. Great Seal -- Seal better way & refuse to leak, never leave a leaky mess in your car or bag. You can safely store these refillable glass bottles in the fridge. Easy Clean -- Dishwasher safe for simple care, or can be cleaned with a brush. The smooth glass makes it easy to clean either way you want. Multiple Usage -- It's ideal for water, juices, syrups, dressings, brewing kombucha. Perfect to use these to store water for meal times. It could be also used to water flower.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/610nNjIlSKL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Flowersea","source_asin":"B078LS9JS3","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1152244","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B078LS9JS3","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B078LS9JS3","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":1152245,"name":"Make Em Laugh I See In Your Future - 11x14 Unframed Art Print - Great Vintage Bizarre, Strange, Occult, Fortune Teller Home Decor and Unique Gift Unde","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":11.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71vl2jOlJQL._AC_SL1200_.jpg","description":"UNFRAMED PRINT - I have to put this in for the people that don't read the words Unframed Print in the title. Of course if they didn't read the title or the words on the pictures they probably won't read this LOL. We tried. It's a print. It's not printed on wood, stone, slate, matboard, or any other kind of substrate. It's not thick sign, it's a print. It's not framed. That's why every picture says \"Frame not Include\". If you did read this far, Thank You MAKES A GREAT GIFT - My huge portfolio makes it easy to find the perfect gift for the people you care about. Friends love to get them for Birthdays, Christmas, Hanukkah, weddings, anniversaries, retirement, graduation, Father's Day, Mother's Day, Valentine's Day or house warming. Makes a great gift for your friends, husband, wife, son daughter mom, dad, co-workers, grandfather, grandmother, aunt uncle, cousin, spouse, or boss PERFECT FOR ANY ROOM - They look great in living rooms, dens, bedrooms, kitchens, entries, dining rooms, bathrooms, offices, man-caves, she sheds, home bars, game rooms, dorms or garages READY TO FRAME - You get one 11\"x 14\" print. 11\" x 14\" frames are super easy to buy here on Amazon or at any department or craft store. Choose the frames that work with your decor and the print! PROUDLY MADE IN THE USA - All of my designs are printed here in the good-old USA and packages at our studio in Tomball, TX by a hard-working group of employees that still care about producing quality products LOVE IT OR SEND IT BACK - It's pretty simple, love it or we'll gladly take it back. That's it!","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71vl2jOlJQL._AC_SL1200_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Make Em Laugh","source_asin":"B08V24F91N","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1152245","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B08V24F91N","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B08V24F91N","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
