window.products.push({"id":1152255,"name":"Fiumara Apparel Bib Apron with 2 Patch Pockets 30\"L X 24\" W - Made in USA","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71jNIb96OzL._AC_UL1500_.jpg","description":"Poly,Cotton Made in USA machine wash MADE IN THE USA: There is nothing better than premium American made products. This unisex server apron is constructed in the United States with pride, and great attention to detail. YES, there still are garments made in the United States. DURABLE, WELL MADE: These popular two pocket bib aprons are made of high quality American 7.5 oz. 65/35 poly/cotton twill fabric. Function comes with these aprons too; two pockets 8\"L x 9\"W Pockets on the front allow for ample storage and space for whatever employees may need.  All Bib Apron fabric has a Canvas like feel for Durability. Unlike many imported products, our Fiumara aprons do not use “heat fused” tie ends, but is quality crafted by using better made “finished” tie ends. UNIQUE FABRIC: This bib apron offers appearance and function for those who prefer a classic look. With reinforced bar tacking to keep the apron held together and looking Professional, any server or chef can't go wrong with this choice. This bib Apron has stain and wrinkle resistant finish, color steadfast for vibrant colors through many wash cycles. UNISEX SIZING: This professional grade Fiumara bib apron is made for both men and women. This bib apron from Fiumara Apparel offers a basic yet classic appearance for server and chef uniforms. 30” long, 24” wide, and featuring 35” extra-long ties in the back, the apron rests around the neck with an adjustable strap. The precision cut patterns and reinforced stress points are meticulously sewn by our proud team in our USA factory. IDEAL FOR WAITSTAFF - This is a popular apron for food service workers. The 2 pocket design enables waiters, waitresses, & bartenders to separate their needed items to service their customers, and reach for them with ease. The apron has soil release and wrinkle resistant finish, and sturdy bar tacking at all stress points to keep your chef or server looking professional and presentable all shift long. These aprons are manufactured in USA with American fabric and are available in different color.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71jNIb96OzL._AC_UL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Fiumara Apparel","source_asin":"B007L82O94","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1152255","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B007L82O94","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B007L82O94","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":1152256,"name":"Yardom 7 in 1 Wood Fired Pellet Grill and Smoker,795 sq. in.,Hopper Quick-Clear with Digital Controls,Temp Probe,Cover","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51XRSMS+L6L._AC_SL1001_.jpg","description":"It uses only all-natural cooking-grade woodpellets for fuel. No gas, propane or charcoal. Built to last and designed todeliver immediate success. The easy to operate Digital Control Center ovencontrol gives you precise control from 85 Fahrenheit to 475 Fahrenheit. And byusing the included meat probe interface, you can cook and control automaticallywith precision. An electric ignition and fan-forced air accelerate and maintaina clear burning flame for an abundance of convection heat and clean, flavorfulsmoke. Best of all, you get nearly 800 square inches cooking surface: 565 squareinch main surface and 230 square inch removable upper cooking rack. With theamazing versatility and flavor of real wood cooking, the PGA795 will allow anynew or aspiring backyard cook to smoke ribs, jerky, fish; bake biscuits, pizza;Grill burgers, vegetables, or sear or charbroil a steak with confidence, everytime. How our grills work Set your temperature on the Digital ControlCenter and the grill takes care of the rest. The auger begins feeding allnatural hardwood pellets to the burn pot where they are ignited by a electricstarter: no need for additional fire accelerants. Convection is achieved using a number oftechniques. Air is fan forced into the grill and channeled throughout by ourarched flame broiler. Our exhaust design allows air to circulate evenly alongthe length of the grill and to the top shelf. This combination allows us toachieve uniform heat throughout the unit whether your smoking at 170 Degree F orcooking all the way up to 475 Degree Fahrenheit. Once your done cooking simply press thepower button and the Digital Control Center will safely maintain a cool downperiod before shutting off.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51XRSMS+L6L._AC_SL1001_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Yardom","source_asin":"B08QCDHYL9","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1152256","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B08QCDHYL9","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B08QCDHYL9","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
