window.products.push({"id":1152352,"name":"Japanese Art Print - Crow and Blossoms by Ohara Koson (11\"x16\")","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":12.59,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61Z2H8pbLFL._AC_SL1000_.jpg","description":"This print is a reproduction of a Japanese woodblock print by Ohara Koson from the early 20th century. Reproductions are made as poster prints and giclee prints. It has been reproduced on archival matte paper with premium ink for brilliant color reproduction. The 11 x 17 or 13 x 19 inch dimensions are approximate measurements. Size varies based on original print dimension ratios. However, most Japanese print reproductions are 1/4 to 1/2 of an inch from the approximate dimensions given. Please do not buy a frame until you have received your print as some customization may be necessary to ensure a proper fit.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61Z2H8pbLFL._AC_SL1000_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Shin Hanga and Art Reproductions","source_asin":"B016WGYC7C","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1152352","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B016WGYC7C","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B016WGYC7C","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
