window.products.push({"id":1152364,"name":"Storage Basket [3-Pack], Large Foldable Storage Bins Sturdy Fabric Storage Baskets with Handles for Home Office Closet Baby's Room Nursery, Clothes, B","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81I4hOz6kWS._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"PREMIUM QUALITY & ROPE HANDLE: This storage organizer shelf basket is made of durable linen & thicken environmental EVA fabric. Lined with thin muslin fabric. A sturdy metal rod frame around the top keeps the basket shape. The organizer storage comes with two rope handles for easy slide-in and pulls out of shelves or closets. The cotton rope handles are attached with metal grommets to the basket. The durable and high-quality material ensures a greater product lifespan. MULTI-PURPOSE: This storage container maximizes storage possibilities by providing you lightweight and space-saving solutions. Great for organizing clothes, shoes, books, DVDs, baby products, toys, pet products, towels, blankets, bedsheets, sports gear, office supplies, and many other uses. It can be used as a decorative basket ideal for the living room, bedroom, bathroom, utility room, kids room, nursery room, closet, dorms, laundry room, pantry, or even in the hallway. EASY FOLD & EASY MAINTENANCE: It is a portable design and collapsible for easy storage if not in use. Simply fold the storage basket down flat for space-saving storage when not in use or when needing to transport, providing the convenience to bring along with you anywhere. It is easy to clean, just wipe with a damp sponge or a soft dry cloth. Not recommended to machine wash as there are a metal frame and hard-bottom support inside. SIMPLE & MODERN DESIGN: Attractive and fashionable design is a thoughtful gift idea. It is designed to match interior décor and style in any room in the home or office. Whether it's a housewarming gift or for students living away from home with limited space. Our collapsible storage bins fit the bill and décor! DIMENSION: 15.75''(L) x 11.81''(W) x 7.87''(H) / (40cm x 30cm x 20cm), set of 3 storage cubes for organizing and reducing home or office clutter. Fits well with a variety of storage compartments and shelves. Its large capacity makes it an excellent solution to organize and tidy your home or office space.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81I4hOz6kWS._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Monitaste","source_asin":"B092VLTN3N","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1152364","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B092VLTN3N","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B092VLTN3N","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
