window.products.push({"id":1152382,"name":"Nambe - Holiday Collection - Hanukkah Geo Dreidel with Stand - Set of 2 Pieces - Made with Nambe Alloy and Acacia Wood - Designed by Mikaela Dorfel","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":42.5,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61vR45ldwAL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"EVOLUTION OF TRADITION: Celebrate Hanukkah with the Geo Dreidel with Stand. The Geo Dreidel takes the traditional design of a Dreidel and gives it a spin. Even with its sleek, modern design it still has all the classic functionality of your favorite game piece. FUNCTIONAL CONVENIENCE: This geometrically inspired design features a wood base fitted with a gleaming Alloy square-shaped dreidel. It makes storing your Dreidel both convenient and stylish. When it’s not in use it serves as a home décor piece. CARE FOR DETAILS: Mikaela Dörfel knows that a good product takes more than a creative inspiration: “My design is often inspired by nature, but then I am always looking for a clear structure and a consequent basic principle in all objects. The basic idea has to be right but real quality is a matter of details.” MUSEUM QUALITY DESIGN: Recognized for its award-winning designs for more than 60 years, Nambe’s commitment to timeless beauty, artistic integrity and uncompromising quality is evident in the brand’s collection of serve ware, barware, home décor and gift items. Nambe collaborates with the world’s most esteemed designers to develop products that bring function and style into the home. PRODUCT SPECIFICATIONS: Package contains (1) Nambe Hanukkah Geo Dreidel with Stand. Made of Nambé Alloy and Acacia Wood. Measures 3-inches L x 2.5-inches W x 3-inches H. Care instructions: Hand wash; dry immediately. Designed by Mikaela Dörfel in 2017.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61vR45ldwAL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"nambe","source_asin":"B07B2H8XYM","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1152382","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07B2H8XYM","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07B2H8XYM","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
