window.products.push({"id":1152475,"name":"Lenox Holiday Santa Sleigh Caddy","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61I90iebYjL._AC_SL1080_.jpg","description":"Offered is one Santa sleigh caddy / centerpiece complete with salt and pepper shakers in the Lenox Holiday pattern. The sleigh measures approx. 9\" long x 5 3/8\" Wide x 6\" Tall. Perfect for a festive table, this Holiday centerpiece puts all your dining essentials in one convenient place. The gifts in Santa's sleigh are salt and pepper shakers, the space behind him is designed for napkins, and the three sections at the back of the sleigh hold forks, knifes, and spoons. This piece is beautifully hand painted with the Holiday holy motif and accented in 24k gold. This centerpiece is sure to make a statement on any table.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61I90iebYjL._AC_SL1080_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Lenox","source_asin":"B077J7QGPD","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1152475","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B077J7QGPD","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B077J7QGPD","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":1152476,"name":"[Upgraded] 99PCS Ice Ball Maker Mold, Ice Cube Tray with Lid and Bin, 3 Pack Ice Trays for Freezer, Round Ice Cube, Mini Circle Ice Cube Tray with Box","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71Br1c8dDML._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"🥑[UPGRADED] FOOD-GRADE MATERIAL - Ice ball maker mold is made of food grade plastic material, safety and durability.The material of the ice bucket is upgraded, which is resistant to falling and not easy to be damaged. BPA free, no smell. Ice cube tray makes 33 pcs 1.1 inch ice balls. Come with 3 pack ice cube tray, you will get 99 pcs small round ice cube. 🍓FLEXIBLE & EFFORTLESS RELEASE- The ice tray is made of high quality plastic for easier release of ice balls.After taking the ice trays out of the refrigerator, wait 5 minutes, twist the ice tray slightly, the ice balls will be released soon. 🍉SATISFY MULTIPLE USES - The circle ice cubes are perfect for whiskey, cocktails,smoothie, coffee, juices, or other mixed drinks. You can also fill fruits, jelly, baby food, vegetable puree, yogurt and chocolate into molds. Enjoy your favorite flavor. 🍒HOW TO USE?- Round ice cube tray includes a tray and a lid with small round holes. To get the perfect round ice balls, fill the ice tray over the sink sline, then close the lid and squeeze out the excess water, put in refrigerator. ❄️ICE CUBE TRAY SET- Package contains 3 pack mini Ice cube trays, ice cube container and lid, scoop. Ice trays can be stacked to save space in the refrigerator. Perfect ice maker for home, parties, restaurants, holiday and bars etc. ✅If the product is damaged, please contact us in time to replace","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71Br1c8dDML._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Kewhunt","source_asin":"B09XCB27L6","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1152476","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09XCB27L6","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B09XCB27L6","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
