window.products.push({"id":1152544,"name":"Atlantic Furniture Nantucket Bunk Bed, Twin/Twin, White","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71LIRUgTTEL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"The Nantucket Bunk Bed takes you back to that cottage on the beach. Designed using tongue & groove panels with substantial corner posts, this bunk will last for generations. When you no longer need a bunk, the Nantucket easily converts into two individual beds. Available in twin-over-twin, twin-over-full, and full-over-full, with optional under-bed storage drawers or a twin trundle bed.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71LIRUgTTEL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Atlantic Furniture","source_asin":"B006ZMJJGS","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1152544","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B006ZMJJGS","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B006ZMJJGS","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":1152545,"name":"Wuudi Laundry Bags, Delicates Mesh Laundry Lingerie Protection Washing Drying Bags for Blouse, Hosiery, Stocking, Underwear, Bra and Lingerie Set of 6","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61aeB1CruyL._AC_SL1200_.jpg","description":"Product details: Product Name: Laundry Bags Zipper Color: Pink Laundry Bag Color: White Product Material: Polyester Product Category: Laundry Bags  Package Included: 3 pieces with M AND 3 pieces with L.   Choose the BEST to protect delicates, extend the life of lingerie, hosiery, intimates and more. Our superior quality delicates laundry bags has advanced flow technology, which gives you a cleaner wash and rinse. Multi-purpose usage: Laundry bag or organizer bag for garments when you travel around the world Warranty: Wuudi laundry mesh bags support refund or replacement guarantees with in 3 months.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61aeB1CruyL._AC_SL1200_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"wuudi","source_asin":"B01H6X6J8U","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1152545","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B01H6X6J8U","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B01H6X6J8U","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":1152546,"name":"Calphalon Simply 12-Inch Nonstick Omelette Fry Pan with Lid","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81R9CNgdmOL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Simply Calphalon Nonstick cookware brings durability and performance to your kitchen. The long-lasting non stick cookware surface consistently delivers delicious results followed by easy cleanup, while durable, hard-anodized aluminum construction promotes fast and even heating. Silicone handles feel comfortable and stay cool on the stovetop. Add a tempered glass cover to the frying pan and a breakfast classic becomes indispensable round-the-clock. Its hard-anodized aluminum construction ensures that eggs cook up quickly and evenly -- but also browns chicken breasts beautifully. Low, sloped sides, a nonstick interior, and sturdy, comfortable handle make flipping your omelet an over-easy proposition -- but also makes tossing sautéed green beans a snap. Slip on the cover to braise pork chops or slowly simmer a fresh tomato sauce.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81R9CNgdmOL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Calphalon","source_asin":"B00485D8HA","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1152546","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B00485D8HA","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B00485D8HA","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":1152547,"name":"PackIt Freezable Classic Lunch Box, Navy Buffalo","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81bokWe45HL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"The old-school lunchbox is getting PackIt's cool twist! PackIt's Fully Freezable Lunch Box is the only lunchbox with built-in cooling that chills food and drinks for hours. The secret is PackIt's groundbreaking technology: a freezable non-toxic gel liner is integrated into the walls of the lunch box. The design totally eliminates the need for separate ice packs or gel packs! To use, simply flatten the lunch box and place it in the freezer overnight (12 hours for optimal results). In the morning, the walls of the lunch box will be completely frozen and ready to chill. With fully frozen walls, this lunchbox keeps food cooler longer, which means you can pack healthier foods that would spoil in other lunch boxes such as: dairy, deli meats, salads, fruits and veggies. The Classic Freezable Lunch Box by PackIt easily fits an entire meal and a 12 ounce (340ml) drink. A top-load design makes this lunch box simple to pack, and its kid-friendly zipper closure locks in cold, dry air. A slim exterior zip pocket is perfect for lunchbox notes, ID cards, napkins or wipes. A buckle handle lets you clip the lunchbox onto totes, backpacks or sports bags. PackIt's Classic Lunchbox is made with nontoxic gel and gel liner. Like all PackIt products, the Classic Lunchbox is made from PVC free, BPA free, phthalate, and lead free (UL #B80321985, 12/5/2019) materials. Care: wipe thoroughly or hand wash the interior and spot clean exterior; allow bag to dry completely before freezing. Not machine or dishwasher safe. PackIt's Classic Freezable Lunch Box measures 8.25 inches tall standing upright, 10 inches wide from side to side and 4.25 inches front to back/deep. When collapsed for freezing, it measures a slim 8.5 by 10 by 2.25 inches for easy storage in the freezer.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81bokWe45HL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"PackIt","source_asin":"B078H6538V","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1152547","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B078H6538V","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B078H6538V","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
