window.products.push({"id":1152599,"name":"Kajiewo Music Box, 3D Crystal Ball Music Box with Warm Light Projection, 360 ° Rotating Kids Night Light Room Decor Gift for Girls Women Kids Mom Birt","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":36.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71qvYRnAhhL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"💖The Music Box Is Made Of K9 Crystal. A three-dimensional \"Planet\" image is processed in a transparent and beautiful high-quality crystal ball. Artistic light and sound sculpture! We will protect your precious memories and your time with immutable sounds and melodies. Song: The theme of Laputa-Castle In The Sky. 💝Warm Night Light. With 12 LED lights, LED lighting that slowly emits warm colors is illuminated under the crystal glass, creating breathtaking beauty and splendor. Since it is rechargeable, it can also be used as a bedside lamp or a flashlight. It is also very useful before going to bed, during a power outage, or in the event of a disaster. Battery capacity: 1200mAh, Charging time: 2-3H, Lighting time: 8-12H. 💗Enjoy Your Own Time. When you rotate the main spring at the bottom of the base, the sound of an 18-valve music box (made by Nidec Sankyo) sounds, and the LED lights up while the base rotates slowly in association with it. 2 to 3 revolutions of the metal disc are enough for about 1 minute of music. So that you can relax physically and mentally and immerse yourself in the calm world. It's very romantic and dreamy. 💚Amazing Projection. When the ball is placed on the base on which the crystal is lit, it glows and a beautiful lotus pattern is projected on the ceiling, creating a romantic atmosphere and making you feel happy just looking at it. You can listen to the music box while looking at the beautiful bezel, and it's definitely a cure! (Note: the lower the ceiling, the better the projection effect.) 💙Best Gift. The base is made of natural beech wood and is handmade. Therefore, all wooden bases have different patterns. Natural color, no color, natural and environmentally friendly. A fantastic crystal ball and a luxurious base made of pure wood are the perfect combination. As a Christmas or Valentine's Day gift, birthday party or various souvenirs, it is also ideal to give away with an unforgettable song.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71qvYRnAhhL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Kajiewo","source_asin":"B0B5WJVZY4","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1152599","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0B5WJVZY4","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0B5WJVZY4","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":1152600,"name":"Air Fryer Liners 100pcs, Firstake 8inch Air Fryer Disposable Paper Liner, Non-stick Unbleached Air Fryer Parchment Paper Liners, Oil-proof, Water-proo","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":11.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/7113NaF-gvL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"✅【GAME CHANGER】- Do you like cooking with the air fryer but cleaning it has always been a headache? These liners are amazing for the air fryer! Throw away the mess and give a simple wipe down of the air fryer basket after use. You can cook various food which with a messy residue behind, all you had to do was remove the liner and that was it. This disposable paper liner can effectively keep the food messy residue away from fryer. No mess to clean up afterwards which was grate. ✅【HEALTHY FOOD GRADE DISPOSABLE PAPER LINER】- This unbleached air fryer parchment paper is made from natural 100% wood pulp and totally fluorescent free. Food grade silicone oil coating makes your baking safe and non-toxic. Our disposable air fryer liners are Non-stick, Oil-proof, Water-proof, Food Grade and Heat-resistant. ✅【EASY TO COOK A VARIETY OF DELICIOUS】- The air fryer disposable paper liner is designed with a round bowl shape, which do not need to tear, fold, cut or bend, and you can directly put it in the air fryer when you are ready to cook. Its heightened edge 1.8 inches can protect the side of fryers and prevent food from sticking to them. Compared with air fryer liners with holes, Our air fryer liners will be no trouble of oil flowing out of the hole and soiling the fryer. ✅【HEAT RESISTANCE UP TO 428℉】- This non-stick air fryer parchment paper is heat-resistant, and you can safely use it in the refrigerator or in the oven and microwave. Our durable air fryer liners can withstand temperatures up to 428°F (220°C). And the air fryer liner has no effect on the taste of food. ✅【VERSATILE AIR FRYER DISPOSABLE PAPER LINER】- Do you think this disposable paper liner is only used for air fryer basket? NO! This air fryer parchment paper suitable for air fryer, microwave, oven, instant pot, frying pan, steamer etc, you can find it everywhere in kitchen. The air fryer liners can be applied for baking, roasting, frying, or serving food, suitable for home baking, camping, BBQ, summer party, holiday party or outdoor camping occasions, lightweight and practical. ✅【AIR FRYER PARCHMENT PAPER LINER PACKAGE】- 100PCS/set, bottom width 8 inches, height 1.8 inches, perfect for 4-8 quart Air Fryer. It is recommended to buy 8 \" X-Large size, and the capacity is more in line with the needs of the family and compatible with more air fryers. Please make sure that food are evenly and completely placed on the top of the air fryer liners to avoid air fryer liners flying away or curling. Please DO NOT put in the air fryer liners when pre-heating.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/7113NaF-gvL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"firstake","source_asin":"B08VJ15DLV","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1152600","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B08VJ15DLV","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B08VJ15DLV","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
