window.products.push({"id":1152686,"name":"GEOSUNNY Kneeling Chair 18\"x 8\"- Ergonomic PU Leather Office Seat with Adjustable Knee Pad, Foot & Arm Rests - Soft Cushion, Thick Latex Memory Foam L","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71tDUIlmP9L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Can't bear sitting on your office chair all day long? Working in an office means having to sit on a chair for extended time periods. As the hours go by, you will find yourself slouching or hunching over, adding pressure and stress to your back, neck, and shoulders. Aside from causing back aches, poor sitting posture can also have a negative effect on your health. Our ergonomic kneeling chair is all about keeping you in a relaxed and proper sitting position all day. Give your body a break and ditch your old office chair for the GEOSUNNY Kneeling Chair! Keep your back, buttocks, legs, and feet comfortably aligned whenever you take a seat on this chair. It is designed to keep you in a relaxed kneeling position while you work, helping reduce the pressure that leads to back aches, pains, or stiffness. If you often find yourself slouching, our ergonomic chair may help correct your sitting posture. This chair is fitted with a 4\" thick kneeling pad, which is paired with adjustable foot rests to support your legs. The 5\" PU leather seat cushion features a layer of gel memory foam for increased softness and comfort. Choose a chair that revolves around your needs. This kneeling chair features a lever and a long top bar, which lets you change the seat's height in seconds. The footrest also offers 3 adjustment levels, extending the bespoke comfort to your legs. Need more time to decide? Here are more reasons to love this kneeling chair: - Measures 20.5 x 13.8 x 43\" when assembled - Elegant black color - Comes with a wooden roller, an LED lamp, a keyboard and mouse pad, and a posture corrector - Ideal for office workers or students - Thoughtful gift idea Don't let back aches or pains disrupt your productivity. Add the GEOSUNNY Kneeling Chair to your cart TODAY!","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71tDUIlmP9L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"GEOSUNNY","source_asin":"B09CPFYL8G","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1152686","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09CPFYL8G","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B09CPFYL8G","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
