window.products.push({"id":1152712,"name":"4 Bend Stainless Steel Straws Extra LONG fits 30 oz Yeti Tumbler Rambler Cups - CocoStraw Brand Drinking Straw (4 Bend Straws + Straw Lid)","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":9.98,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81zBCbYdfuL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"CUPS NOT INCLUDED! Straws ONLY For 20oz & 30oz cup size- please see the photos to see how they fit in each size of the tumbler. 4 pack of \"Bend\" style Premium Stainless Steel Drinking straws that fit in the lid of the Yeti Rambler Tumblers Travel Mugs + 1 Stainless Steel Cleaning Brush OTHER Stainless Straws will NOT fit in the Yeti cup top, they are too wide to fit in the small lid hole! These straws allow you to sip your drink without removing the lid. Please see the photos showing how they fit Elegant Brushed Stainless Steel Drinking Straw fits both 20 oz and 30 oz Rambler To Go Vacuum Mugs 9.5\" length as shown in photos, 1/4\" diameter. Cocostraw is the #1 Trusted Stainless Steel Drinking Straw Brand. Each Pack is Sealed in Full Color CocoStraw Branded Recyclable Packaging. Dishwasher SAFE. Crafted from Elegant Polished 100% Food Grade Stainless Steel. Type 304 grade 18/8. Will Not Rust, Dent or Break Long Full Length Cleaning Brush included in every pack. Brushes have a stainless steel handle and are constructed with Heavy Duty Nylon Bristles that Cleans Easy. again, PLEASE NOTE-- NO Travel Rambler Yeti Cups are included here, This is ONLY for the 4qty Stainless Steel Straws that fit the cup & the straw cleaning brush. These straws are from the CocoStraw Brand, they are not affiliate with the Yeti brand in any way. Also includes a Stainless Steel Straw Cleaning Brush. DISHWASHER SAFE! Re-Usable, Washable, Eco-Friendly. Straws are indestructible! Will not crack or bend. NOTE- CocoStraw also has an 8.5\" Straight Yeti Style Straw perfect for the 20oz cup size and a 10.5\" Length Straight Style for the 30oz Yeti Tumblers.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81zBCbYdfuL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"CocoStraw","source_asin":"B077N6RJR2","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1152712","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B077N6RJR2","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B077N6RJR2","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":1152713,"name":"RAYAIR SUPPLY 18x24 MicroPower Guard Air Cleaner Replacement Filter Pads (3 Pack) Yellow","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":59.79,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51T0R15EVVL._AC_.jpg","description":"This high quality replacement media is for use in a: Micropower Guard, Nature's Home MicroPower Guard, One Hour Xenon Power Guard. These air cleaners utilize polarized media technology enabling it to capture submicron respirable particles. This design provides for simpler filter media changes while still removing the smallest (submicron) particles. Based on average service conditions, approximately 3-4 months between filter cleaning has been shown to be effective in maintaining adequate ventilation flow. Material: The fiberglass media is manufactured from 100% recycled crushed glass known as “cullet.\" The continuous glass fiber manufacturing process eliminates the potential hazards of respirable fiberglass particles within the media pad. The diameter of each fiber is greater than 18 microns which is well above the 3.5 micron size that has been attributed to health concerns. How does it work? When particles such as dust, pet dander and household chemicals pass through the filter, they become polarized. These polarized particles join together to form bigger clusters that are more easily captured and collect on the fiberglass pad with an activated carbon center screen. The full sheet activated carbon center media pad is a non-woven polyester base fabric. The carbon media is UL certified for flame retardancy, class 2. The fiberglass media becomes polarized by the charge from the power supply and acts like a powerful magnet to attract sub-micron particles. What is included? Three (3 Changes) fiberglass media pads with activated carbon center per order. CAUTION: Do not place order using the measurement of disposable fiberglass pad. Measure the outside frame or refer to filter label inside plastic channel. ** The products advertised on this page are manufactured by RayAir Supply. MicroPower Guard is a registered trademark of Clockworks IP, LLC. RayAir Supply is not affiliated with Clockworks IP, LLC.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51T0R15EVVL._AC_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"RAYAIR SUPPLY","source_asin":"B06XXJVLYQ","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1152713","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B06XXJVLYQ","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B06XXJVLYQ","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
