window.products.push({"id":1152965,"name":"Tablecraft Cake Stand with Dome, Clear Acrylic Shatterproof Lid Cover with Stainless Steel Display Pedestal, Domed to Fit 12 Inches in Diameter Cakes,","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":37.44,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61xo0J8bfUL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Show off the quality and freshness of your playfully decorated cakes, pies, cupcakes, and muffins with this attractive stainless steel cake stand. The eye catching, non-revolving cake stand provides excellent product visibility, and is ideal for diners, bakeries, family restaurants, or any location that sells baked goods. This stainless steel cake stand can hold up to a 12\" diameter cake. Set includes cake stand and cover. Hand wash only. Dimensions: 12.875\"x12.875\"x6.75\". Stainless Steel.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61xo0J8bfUL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Tablecraft","source_asin":"B08QQHC48R","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1152965","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B08QQHC48R","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B08QQHC48R","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":1152966,"name":"Sprouting Kit, 3 Set Plastic Sprouting Lids with Stainless Steel Screen/Blackout Sleeves/Tray/Brush, Sprouts Growing Kit for Growing Broccoli Mung Bea","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":14.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/711MH5jnsvL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Sprouting Kit: You will receive 3pcs sprouting lid, 3pcs drip tray, 3pcs blackout sleeve and 1pc brush, you only need to add seeds to jars and then grow fresh sprouts. Controllable light source: Most leafy green sprouts like indirect sunlight, while bean and grain sprouts will grow longer and sweeter in darker conditions. So we've included blackout sleeves where you can control the light coming in. Drip tray design: We use a drip tray with vents. After you filter the water in the lid, you only need to place the lid upside down on the drip tray to allow the seeds to ventilate and drain better and ensure the success rate of germination. Germination Steps: Our germination kit is very simple to operate, you only need to prepare the seeds, jars and water, first soak the seeds for about 6-8 hours, then rinse the sprouts with water twice a day, it only takes 2 to 4 days Fresh organic sprouts available. Even if you've never grown sprouts before, you'll love this sprouting kit! Multifunctional use: Our sprouting kit is healthy and environmentally friendly, and is not easy to break. At the same time, the large lids mouth design is easy to take, easy to clean, and the bud output is sufficient. Great for beans, nuts, grains, broccoli, lentil sprouts, alfalfa seeds and more.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/711MH5jnsvL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Emsiok","source_asin":"B0C1C22PG5","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1152966","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0C1C22PG5","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0C1C22PG5","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
