window.products.push({"id":1152996,"name":"Aliyoham Electric Grill Outdoor/Indoor Electric BBQ Grill, Non-stick Plate Smokeless with Thermostat, Portable Removable Stand Grill, Kitchen Garden B","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61Y-KYPPWDS._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"★★SAFETY & WARRANTY★★: Our product is etl listed. 12-month warranty. At the back of the body, there is a METAL HOOK, BUCKLE it to electrify. Move the heating element a bit to left until hearing a \"clank\" sound which means micro-switch connected(See PIC 2). Then turn on the thermostat control, it's working when indicator is on. If the grill seperate from the heating element accidently, it would stop working. Aliyoham Product: Our Electric grill with thermostat, non-stick and smokeless. 1700 Watts, 120 volts. Grill size 20x12 inch, 240 Square inches of Grilling Surface. Two ways of barbeque, either put on the table, or stand in the living room, kitchen, and garden. UNIQUE DESIGN: Adjustable height for faster or slower grilling. Thermostat for control temperature. Bottom shelf for placing food and seasoning. The grill is perfect for Steak, Fish, vegetable, meat, bacon, pepper, shrimp,etc. This product is great for family cooking and indoor BBQs, also suitable for camping, caravan and self-catering holidays. PREMIUM QUALITY: The whole body is heat-resistant, hands won’t get scalded. Grill uses best food grade material, not deformed and can be reused. Aluminum foil can be placed on the grill as well. Oil drip pan is made of zinc, easy clean after use. INSTRUCTIONS: For assembly instruction, please watch the video for details. For User Manual please check graphic introduction and guides(pdf) below. If you have any question, message us any time, we'll provide after-sale service.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61Y-KYPPWDS._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Aliyoham","source_asin":"B097MT828V","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1152996","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B097MT828V","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B097MT828V","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
